    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but thats the thing... it doesn't feel like i can \"reconnect.\" it feels like there's nothing to reconnect to. like the \"real\" world is just a concept i read about once. everything feels so hollow and quiet. it would be so much easier if i just stopped trying to force this feeling of being real. like, if i dont exist, then it doesnt hurt so much to feel nothing.",
